#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Verify and fix metadata for a music library laid out as
<root>/<artist>/<album>/<song>.<ext>.

Folder names are trusted for artist and album. Titles and track numbers
come from MusicBrainz, matched by the filename's track number or else
its title. A recording's full credit (main + featured artists) goes in
a separate "artists" tag; "artist" stays as the folder name.

scan only queues changes: metadata to tmp/changes.yml and album art to
tmp/art (tmp is relative to the current directory, not root). Steps
that modify files take --dry-run to print what they'd change instead.
A ".mmfignore" file in root (".gitignore" syntax) excludes matches
from every step.

See README.md for setup and examples.
"""

